B:Allans Music Folio No 37 "Reels, Jigs, Hornpipes, Etc for Piano".
N:Older versions date back to the mid - late c.18th; e.g.
N:- VMP, Thos Cahusac, "24 Country Dances", No 15, (1758) as "Bob Sanders"
N:- AIRDS, V.1 No 105, (c.18th) as "Pady Whack"
N:- VMP, Joseph Barnes Ms. No 89, (1762) as "Paddy Wack"
N:There are many other versions.
